# Wall segment: a plain square physical barrier - no field, no power, just mass and health.
# Placed as a two-click LINE (segments every 2 m along the path). Enemies gnaw through it or go
# around; a cheap way to shape their approach. Spawned origin 1.2 above ground.
Prefab gameWall
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.55 0.55 0.6
		Scale 1
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1 1
